Do not let Dashboard changes, Wrangler, Terraform, and scripts conflict without an explicit ownership model.

Separate:
- Local development.
- Preview.
- Staging.
- Production.

Verify environment-specific bindings and settings.

Never assume Wrangler child environments automatically inherit all parent configuration.

Keep secrets outside source code and browser bundles.

Do not change production DNS, production secrets, or live infrastructure without explicit authorization.

